OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 52 homes in village
OL,4,Araise 'grave concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village could get dozens of new homes
OL,7,Fif two planning applications are
OL,8,Fapproved have prompted "grave concerns"
OL,9,Ffrom a councillor.
OL,11,FShropshire councillors are due to
OL,12,Fconsider plans for a 42-property
OL,13,Fdevelopment and another for 10 homes at
OL,14,Fa meeting next Tuesday.
OL,16,FWhittington councillor David Walker and
OL,17,Flocal residents have raised concerns
OL,18,Fabout the impact on the character of
OL,19,Fthe village, road safety, flooding,
OL,20,Fsustainability and access to services.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
